Whale-chan original SVG character art
=====================================

`art/whale-chan.svg` and `art/sprites/*.webp` are original fan artwork created
for this plugin. They follow the visual specification of the community
DeepSeek Whale-chan project, but do not copy or redistribute that project's
reference images. The sprite images were generated with Animagine XL 4.0
(CreativeML Open RAIL++-M) and cut out with BiRefNet (MIT).

Character concept and specification:
- DeepSeek Whale-chan (深度求索 鲸鱼娘), community project:
  https://github.com/Neko3000/deepseek-whalechan
- Original character credits named by that project:
  ZipZipPipe (https://space.bilibili.com/4168597)
  上善无形 (https://space.bilibili.com/4456176)

